ame","www.welivesecurity.com"],["url","https://www.welivesecurity.com/en/eset-research/dynowiper-update-technical-analysis-attribution/"]]]]]]},{"anchors":{"0":"instance--ad592d05-6969-5b51-98a8-1ad9b6aab896","120":"instance--5850a8f4-8241-5e73-9bf0-dcd376cd5025","150":"instance--0da1498f-3beb-5916-a249-e0410a4a81e4","180":"instance--d3632784-7391-5a29-83e2-edab51db56c6","210":"instance--8bc47ca5-ca73-5a04-a9ea-918608f10871","240":"instance--6546eef6-c5ad-516e-a417-89916e651648","270":"instance--244e5a69-f465-564e-9d2c-93d4da44fc57","30":"instance--6a1fca3c-fdb6-536a-bbea-61ac2349a700","300":"instance--043a5b44-2864-5565-abce-1909204e5485","330":"instance--e10eb918-2b0b-56f4-9c82-f345ce21276c","60":"instance--33a99d1b-dad8-51f6-be74-e1614db9151b","90":"instance--380c79e9-b1eb-547c-bf01-a011db1201c1"},"id":"action","instance":"attack-action--1","properties":[["name","Attempt download of Impacket"],["description","In early stages of the attack, attackers attempted to download the publicly available tool. The following path was used: ."],["confidence",0.0],["ttp",{"tactic":"TA0042","technique":"T1588.002"}]]},{"anchors":{"0":"instance--4f4d03a8-4502-5010-997b-9943e254395b","120":"instance--cefe62ac-5b6e-5ead-84fc-b4c632913a73","150":"instance--4d07a740-2467-5b95-ac8d-4a2ee8edd11e","180":"instance--1205f03c-a457-5a0b-87ef-3bbb7aac110f","210":"instance--96e7dc6a-9f86-5f69-8d45-a566303cd4c0","240":"instance--66237af6-bb19-5a51-9fa2-cbc4a96186f5","270":"instance--836dfd42-b475-50ca-9acf-4f11bd32b89f","30":"instance--efe92997-cc5c-538a-90bc-c09ffb1379f4","300":"instance--9c4a24ae-1426-5cb5-9d7c-792e6dd325b7","330":"instance--06c6a74a-ca7d-5703-88ea-a06a0933d21a","60":"instance--5e4f84e5-56b7-5b8f-9bc3-b4d59d371123","90":"instance--019deb6a-bab3-57db-9a53-11e3564bf7a4"},"id":"action","instance":"attack-action--2","properties":[["name","Dump LSASS with Task Manager"],["description","In early December 2025, attackers attempted to dump the LSASS process using Windows Task Manager."],["confidence",0.0],["ttp",{"tactic":"TA0006","technique":"T1003.001"}]]},{"anchors":{"0":"instance--0ce35aea-35a2-52ae-a67b-985306bdefe7","120":"instance--312639d5-e6d9-57b1-850d-28f0a1eac2f6","150":"instance--9551a25e-2558-512e-9894-dd64a8d662bf","180":"instance--403becce-e0ad-5dcd-bc14-7c00453907da","210":"instance--2305f501-2712-5ec6-9d4e-1371b011e937","240":"instance--cf1b8cf6-1cbd-5afb-b653-aa693889dab5","270":"instance--1d3dc59a-40a0-5670-aa3e-1304ff762003","30":"instance--77063d4f-503a-5e9b-b622-15aa2cc6a8e7","300":"instance--beaab67f-8a54-5982-8c5d-9d2ed2d42c9f","330":"instance--4d3274ff-ef14-5a53-99be-01575194a98e","60":"instance--4154a6bf-290b-5fce-a557-5dc0f3e700fb","90":"instance--2992bc0b-df57-54e5-a17b-03a964338c09"},"id":"action","instance":"attack-action--3","properties":[["name","Download and launch PySoxy"],["description","Additionally, they tried to download and launch a publicly available SOCKS5 proxy tool called . The attackers attempted to execute this proxy in reverse-connect mode using the command line . This server is used by ProGame ( ), a programming school for kids in Vladivostok, Russia, and was likely compromised."],["confidence",0.0],["ttp",{"tactic":"TA0011","technique":"T1090.001"}]]},{"anchors":{"0":"instance--0f6e4da7-a5f4-54d7-866f-3bc6e8bcb019","120":"instance--015254b5-0906-577e-b3e3-3899f837d118","150":"instance--f7af5b8c-330a-58d5-b0da-a3d5f0bc6ad0","180":"instance--9f27ab21-2382-567d-b022-74ad5a29bd08","210":"instance--d799eb0a-7600-5b1a-a298-c47a78ceae4b","240":"instance--911c2c52-5974-5e08-b0b6-a9084d57c6ee","270":"instance--286444b4-97a1-58cd-9ca3-cffa04a15351","30":"instance--92192c38-5143-50e0-8c39-a96ea86e32e2","300":"instance--82bb3de0-bea5-5651-a1de-583283258c6d","330":"instance--4f0945c8-f644-50ce-8796-fea52a29dda1","60":"instance--16c43a2d-7356-521d-a507-5922e2c3337b","90":"instance--abce5c62-339a-5ed5-a0b8-dd66136cfe2f"},"id":"action","instance":"attack-action--4","properties":[["name","Deploy DynoWiper samples to shared directory"],["description","On December 29 , 2025, DynoWiper samples were deployed to the directory, which is likely a shared directory in the victim\u2019s domain, with the following filenames: , , and ."],["confidence",0.0],["ttp",{"tactic":"TA0011","technique":"T1105"}]]},{"anchors":{"0":"instance--a469636c-0cb2-50b9-92f9-644c8aa98197","120":"instance--d57b3a21-e910-5879-8148-40165cea451a","150":"instance--58250ef4-5bb4-5bf3-b33e-89493bbb395d","180":"instance--3e769cf2-c1e5-5d2e-81d4-892f48ce4d86","210":"instance--f6499e41-749c-5d7f-9346-96c08d0d5dfd","240":"instance--d9dcdfc8-5f42-546a-803a-0efcd5d4cf91","270":"instance--c9afd0f6-97ce-57b2-9d60-3557b6214809","30":"instance--75f82155-f5ff-5619-8bf8-aae22937cab0","300":"instance--25e2d26e-1b35-56bd-b9aa-096c2d3b0e3c","330":"instance--e0483688-da10-5376-8cf2-050bcc3b70f0","60":"instance--1293d9cc-16b2-5c67-a453-bd144aab133a","90":"instance--2b43cd52-10db-5b15-8ad5-c4b59496528b"},"id":"action","instance":"attack-action--5","properties":[["name","Execute malware from shared network directory"],["description","More significantly, a deployment script with very similar functionality, but without strong code similarity, was discovered being used to deploy the DynoWiper malware in a Polish energy company. In that case, however, the malicious binary was not distributed to individual computers but was instead executed directly from a shared network directory."],["confidence",0.0],["ttp",{"tactic":"TA0008","technique":"T1570"}]]},{"anchors":{"0":"instance--54fc1f38-f4e3-523e-b07c-73889b0d8df7","120":"instance--9cf45948-7040-5d7a-a1d5-3cb4db0c1af6","150":"instance--13bb13cc-e02b-51d2-8d7d-40e5613b6e5a","180":"instance--e33bc6ee-771e-54fe-a772-74dfdaad420d","210":"instance--286f51a3-8fc6-55ec-978e-8b05ebda3655","240":"instance--14659696-be77-5460-beb1-4b5eac126e43","270":"instance--f48ed1a6-2895-5cd2-9b1c-e30ac2bc8921","30":"instance--7b803e61-16ac-5720-92cd-8f2a456a52b7","300":"instance--76c24361-5143-5c43-8e4d-707c619e6038","330":"instance--f395cfc7-395a-5001-9552-a4fec6dbc53a","60":"instance--760885bb-9294-5a5b-93a2-a410e1ea4112","90":"instance--8e0d1a12-8611-598d-9a7d-40f2525e4781"},"id":"action","instance":"attack-action--6","properties":[["name","Wipe files on removable and fixed drives"],["description","During the first phase, the malware recursively wipes files on all removable and fixed drives, excluding specific directories (using case-insensitive comparison):"],["confidence",0.0],["ttp",{"tactic":"TA0040","technique":"T1561.001"}]]},{"anchors":{"0":"instance--7cccbcd0-a724-54fb-be4f-ac523d26f7d0","120":"instance--738e44b2-1357-5eb3-82bd-8a0ce8942b72","150":"instance--d31f4735-6339-5929-8d7c-d30863cf166f","180":"instance--2252393d-d801-5931-ad38-4b53374a9880","210":"instance--065b5ad5-023a-5336-b458-e9c9dcda2976","240":"instance--5ea0dd2b-5eac-51f8-855a-4cbcb801bc2d","270":"instance--bba66874-a069-56c6-bb95-967cb3cefc9e","30":"instance--6377c09d-ecb4-5567-a2f4-4dde56ff4f98","300":"instance--ede3430f-b16b-58ae-be71-1d1f1a194336","330":"instance--7772f482-8ee2-569a-b600-7528c065d4e0","60":"instance--98139a98-16b0-54fe-8c77-3473c1b520cd","90":"instance--5cb9cc95-e190-5a68-985d-0a94d39299e6"},"id":"action","instance":"attack-action--7","properties":[["name","Remove all files and directories"],["description","For , in the second phase, all files and directories on removable and fixed drives are removed via the API without skipping any directories, and without overwriting files."],["confidence",0.0],["ttp",{"tactic":"TA0040","technique":"T1485"}]]},{"anchors":{"0":"instance--5150f7cc-6f25-5eb3-a6fc-5099ced4caf4","120":"instance--64a408ce-c543-55d6-a9dd-206ce7cadbb2","150":"instance--1b71e413-cfd2-528c-8792-dc7dd1bb9938","180":"instance--aa12ce11-0165-52b6-b72d-e4d9070e9fbb","210":"instance--5d8b0f08-14bc-58f4-9316-b25a92dd09a6","240":"instance--34f96b84-9453-53f2-ae07-d28c04665e6c","270":"instance--415f1d54-1cd4-5ba7-8071-4aa99bc946ac","30":"instance--18834cac-b4c4-57b0-88ea-5a62fdb27cf9","300":"instance--de4f9957-1ac6-5782-86ea-f1a3b6a9ad13","330":"instance--8eff940b-86bb-556f-8c85-c7c47577b3ed","60":"instance--14a123fd-5626-5e69-8257-6dcd64c28ec0","90":"instance--02294ff1-7261-5db8-8e0d-b9e818922053"},"id":"action","instance":"attack-action--8","properties":[["name","Force system reboot"],["description","The third phase forces the system to reboot, completing the destruction of the system."],["confidence",0.0],["ttp",{"tactic":"TA0040","technique":"T1529"}]]},{"anchors":{"0":"instance--35652c79-2c41-5d60-81ba-b5e47aa554bf","120":"instance--53906203-fffb-5af3-b112-44a9b4b49b8f","150":"instance--465fbc8a-7b4c-569f-be00-c0fbc137fcfc","180":"instance--a653c96b-3673-5dfa-968e-188fffe4cc04","210":"instance--6a344cf5-bd5c-52db-84f5-23c7701c7a5e","30":"instance--913561d1-b5f3-54d2-8272-159233dfde54","330":"instance--d59fe52d-c897-5f3a-919a-c2273cb8a8b3","60":"instance--f1fd6a3d-bb83-543d-a379-39d4632978f7","90":"instance--4cd6fce2-0d24-57f0-b161-12a867cd1100","branch:False":"instance--f7e897b3-3607-5ea5-8d15-5f83ba8a60da","branch:True":"instance--39b5ac19-b0dd-5674-a7d9-d75e659fe9ea"},"id":"condition","instance":"attack-condition--1","properties":[["description","We identified additional tools used within the same network prior to deployment of the wiper."]]},{"anchors":{"0":"instance--2ff8b105-17d8-5bc8-9736-a71ca9281068","120":"instance--fe9b11f7-9a07-51c8-93b2-02f34148833b","150":"instance--15f0676c-2f2f-58cf-99a3-b5eade2d286e","180":"instance--cdc5e3d9-a0b4-5995-98a3-d1a29532ffb1","210":"instance--75ed5df8-ff2f-5667-9748-b8587a1ee318","30":"instance--46009917-4258-54e5-9e91-c46c4a45d34d","330":"instance--54845373-a5f0-5af0-b348-5b0a3b4fbe67","60":"instance--f1f8d9a5-1f2a-55c4-af9a-f2629bc0827a","90":"instance--ddfb6e54-4af9-5771-910f-b4c7ba6e9860","branch:False":"instance--64607b7d-a4bd-56e7-9116-7bc21201c8bf","branch:True":"instance--f635d174-aa29-531f-b9c8-0cc481c6c1dd"},"id":"condition","instance":"attack-condition--2","properties":[["description","The wiper overwrites files using a 16-byte buffer that contains random data generated once at the start of the wiper\u2019s execution."]]},{"anchors":{"0":"instance--64fa8274-9976-53b9-811c-a0e7e805b799","120":"instance--ce384754-4013-5515-ac17-4456e1d80bbb","150":"instance--99275651-db0d-57ec-a13c-6e557a4b9c7c","180":"instance--cbaa25ac-4f14-51f0-9962-f76fe36e7cd6","210":"instance--1c4fda5b-4605-5040-a88a-48f1df4144aa","30":"instance--39743932-1858-5655-a859-b27c0902b87a","330":"instance--c116df79-3c10-5931-96ec-25b4174ae13a","60":"instance--75b926aa-d189-5cd6-bc7b-5a947c88de41","90":"instance--4931e63d-9e52-5183-bbd8-7db1814b0f21","branch:False":"instance--fc00a7ae-0a9a-58b7-b24a-5def4ea9feab","branch:True":"instance--e3424864-637f-5b96-b87c-a8dcc22d8b9e"},"id":"condition","instance":"attack-condition--3","properties":[["description","DynoWiper\u2019s workflow can be divided into three distinct phases, which are described later in the text. The samples include only the first two phases and introduce a five-second delay between them. In contrast, implements all three phases and does not include the five-second delay."]]},{"anchors":{"0":"instance--253917f6-0fb3-5fc5-bd71-946fe7eb5b45","120":"instance--3f50f35e-a337-5d55-a037-5b923804b373","150":"instance--e1655f18-961e-5a7c-8605-a43fa92fe621","180":"instance--c536c45c-6edd-5cb6-8ee3-046111b98062","210":"instance--42f3c144-a229-5f85-b5be-d7f7668d557c","240":"instance--691fbaf3-af2f-5133-81cc-3f20013aafe4","270":"instance--2eab6914-e10b-5f1c-99af-5beccbf5d65b","30":"instance--ec3d9f12-fac6-5bd8-b657-4395a88ea91a","300":"instance--c4feed2f-8968-5ca9-9b2c-7d6dc36ae967","330":"instance--076ff030-b45a-5691-bef4-3f176aa05896","60":"instance--eb064d35-3662-50f2-819a-ebf3749e0b27","90":"instance--209d1071-226d-51fe-96d2-a60e78b0f246"},"id":"asset","instance":"attack-asset--1","properties":[["name","Polish energy company"],["description","In December 2025, we detected the deployment of a destructive malwar